<!-- 3. Methodology 板块 -->
<div id="methodology">
  <h3>Methodology</h3>
  <div class="text-center mb-4">
    <!-- 占位图：系统流程图 -->
    <img src="https://placehold.co/1200x400/f8f9fa/333?text=System+Pipeline+SVG+Diagram" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm" style="width: 100%;">
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;"><em>Figure 1: Overview of the SplatSLAM integrated pipeline.</em></p>
  </div>
  <div class="row" style="font-size: 0.95rem;">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <p><strong>1. Data Preprocessing:</strong> 4K video is frame-extracted at 10 FPS using FFmpeg scripts to ensure multi-view consistency.</p>
      <p><strong>2. MASt3R-SLAM:</strong> A Transformer-based front-end estimates per-frame depth and camera poses (TUM format).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <p><strong>3. SOR Refinement:</strong> Removing floaters via statistical neighbor analysis (nb=20, std=1.25) in CloudCompare.</p>
      <p><strong>4. 3DGS Optimization:</strong> Training Gaussian ellipsoids for 30k-50k iterations using Nerfstudio.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

